From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ned <github@edoardo.fyi>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 19:33:37 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 50/75] CD: serve LBN reads, sceCdSearchFile and the IOP CDVD
 from the disc's real LBN map (lbn_map.h); remove pseudo LBNs, leaf/loose
 indexes and the cdImage read path on the EE side

The game reads by real disc LBN. ./rx disc writes <root>/.lbn-map (volume, file extents, non-file gap sectors) and .lbn-gaps.bin; a missing map reports '-> ./rx disc <iso>'. Tests: mid-file read, read across a file boundary, gap sector, zero inside the volume, failure past the volume, sceCdSearchFile returns the real LBN and size. IOP CDVD tries the map first and keeps its virtual ISO only for map-less fixtures.

